<div id="product-overview" class="cmp-text">
    <h2 style="text-align: center;">Most Powerful Rack-scale AI Infrastructure<sup>1</sup></h2>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="subheadline">AMD Instinct™ GPUs and the AMD Helios™ rackscale solution drive frontier AI and HPC in data centers with leading performance, efficiency, and scalability. Built on AMD CDNA™ architecture and the open AMD ROCm™ software stack, which power frontier AI models, training, inference, simulation, and mixed workloads with predictable performance and strong value at any scale.</span></p>

