<p>The AMD Helios design is a fully integrated AI infrastructure, combining the latest AMD Instinct™ GPUs, AMD EPYC™ server CPUs, AMD Pensando™ networking, and AMD ROCm™ software stack, designed using open industry standards enabling large-scale inference, frontier model training and fine-tuning.</p>

